  st01_ingredientText: 'Morning, some chillies for you? To add the heat to the dish,
    you know. '
  st01_ingredientDislikeText: I could eat anything, really, you know.
  st01_skillOfferText: I loved spending time with my nieces when they were kids.
    I'm good with children, you know.
  st01_skillNeedText: 'I want to put up this shelf, you know. But I need an extra
    durable drill, the walls are just too tough.  '
  st03_soupResultText: The spice, the flavour, the love. This soup is just what I
    needed.
  st03_skillOfferText: 'I''m really good with children, you know. We''ll have a good
    time. '
  st03_skillNeedText: 'I need to put a shelf for my new books, but I need an extra
    durable drill. The walls are just too tough, you know. '
